# Constrained element subtype converts compatible elements

Verifies an `int<mm>[]` array converts a compatible element expressed in
another unit to the declared subtype before storage, so 2cm is stored as 20mm
and 1dm as 100mm.

>>> source
let sizes: int<mm>[] = [10mm, 2cm, 1dm]
print(sizes[0])
print(sizes[1])
print(sizes[2])

<<< stdout
10mm
20mm
100mm

<<< stderr
